### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081/api/v1

### 1. Create Locality
POST {{baseUrl}}/localities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "id": "random",
    "locality_name": "Locality A",
    "province_name": "Province A",
    "country_name": "Country A"
  }
}

### 2. GetAll LocalitySellerCount
GET {{baseUrl}}/localities/reportSellers
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Get LocalitySellerCount
GET {{baseUrl}}/localities/reportSellers?id=random
Content-Type: application/json